%% Figure 3.8: State transition diagram for an invoice
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> unpaid : invoice issued (billing run or manual)
    unpaid --> partial : payment recorded, 0 < paid < amount
    unpaid --> paid : payment recorded, paid = amount
    partial --> partial : further payment, paid still < amount
    partial --> paid : final payment, paid = amount
    unpaid --> void : void_invoice() while no payment exists
    partial --> void : rejected — payments already recorded
    paid --> void : rejected — invoice already settled
    void --> [*]
    paid --> [*]

    note right of void
        void_invoice() raises
        ResourceConflictError (HTTP 409)
        if any payment has been recorded.
        Overpayment is likewise rejected:
        paid + new_payment must not
        exceed invoice.amount.
    end note
